# Local SQLite database used when running without Docker/Postgres
# `*.db` alone did not catch `semanticui-dev.db.bak-1786870287`, which
# reached a commit and had to be removed from history before this could
# be published. The suffix form is what the app's own backup step emits.
*.db
*.db.bak-*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
